title: APC InRow Cooling Devices: Fanspeed
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/apc
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
  The current Fanspeed in percent for a InRow Cooling devices.

  The output in only informational and always {OK}.

 This check uses the PowerNet-MIB. It reads the airIRRC objects of older
 InRow units as well as the generic cooling unit status table of newer
 units (e.g. InRow ACRC301S), which do not provide the airIRRC objects
 anymore.

discovery:
 One service is created.
